.vercel

# Video dropped in the project root to be staged into the clip pipeline.
# 80MB of episode does not belong in the repo, and `git add -A` would have
# taken it without asking.
/*.mp4
/*.mov
/*.m4v

# Anything pulled down from Vercel. `vercel env pull` defaults to
# .env.production.local, which the old `.env.local` line did not cover — a
# pulled production key was one `git add -A` from being committed.
.env*.local
